            "review_title": "Review at Com Tam Cali",
            "review_text": "Family Travellers & Realtor\nVietnam98 contributions\n0\nSuitable for families and friends gathering\nJan 2025 • Family\nI had the chance to visit Cơm Tấm Cali, and it was an enjoyable experience. The restaurant offers a cozy atmosphere and fast, friendly service. The cơm tấm (broken rice) with grilled pork was flavorful, with the pork being perfectly cooked—tender and slightly charred. The rice was light and paired well with the tangy fish sauce, creating a great balance of flavors. It’s a good spot to enjoy a classic Vietnamese dish in a comfortable setting. If you're craving a delicious and satisfying meal, Cơm Tấm Cali is definitely worth trying.\nRead more\nWritten January 4, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
