            "review_title": "Review at Com Tam Cali",
            "review_text": "Zfy Ed\nSingapore, Singapore10979 contributions\n0\nNice food as usual!\nDec 2022\nThis is one of the restaurants we always visit whenever in HCMC and always here for it's \"broken rice\", the signature dish.\n\nIn our recent HCMC trip, we also came by again and ordered one of our favourites, broken rice with bbq pork. The portion had shrinked than before (and price gone up) but the meat was well marinated, nice and tasty though a little dry. \n\nWe also ordered the bittergourd with pork soup and the spring rolls (with pork and prawn). The soup was flavourful and nice and surprisingly not bitter at all and the peanut sauce for the spring rolls were tasty!\n\nFor drink, we ordered the iced lemon juice with apple, it's nice, sour-sweet! What a good blend with the food ordered!\n\nThe quality of food here was consistently good and prices were still reasonable despite having gone up. \n\nService staff were attentive and polite and even demonstrated how to eat the food with the dipping sauce. They also brought us additional bowl and utensils.\n\nThe ambience was fine, well lit and was air conditioned. \n\nWe enjoyed our meal here and it didn't disappoint!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 6, 2023",
