            "review_title": "Review at Com Tam Cali",
            "review_text": "ieatirate\nJakarta, Indonesia1392 contributions\n0\nBroken rice\nApr 2018 • Couples\nYou dont consider yourself been to Saigon if you havent tried Com tam (aka broken rice). Broken rice has become the life of Saigonese. It's essentially the broken grains of rice from the traditional ways of drying and milling. Due to advancement in technology, it is now harder to find broken grains and as such the grains have to be purposely grinded to make broken rice. Broken rice may just be the usually grain but the taste of cooked broken rice somehow is different from the usually unbroken rice. The dish Com Tam is usually served with bbq pork, shredded pork skin, egg, sausage etc. A combination that makes you look for broken rice dishes in Saigon.\n.\nFood : 4/5\nService : 3/5\nPrice : $$\nPlace : 3.5/5\n.\nNon Halal\nRest : Com Tam Cali \nLocation : Ho Chi Minh\nCity : Ho Chi Minh\n.\nRead more\nWritten April 5, 2018",
